! CO2 emissions from the emissions reader: co2ff at the surface, co2air01-25 on the
! 0.61 km aviation bands. kg(CO2) m-2 s-1, filled from the coupler.
&NAMCOMPO_EMIS THIS%SPECIES='CO2_GHG', THIS%SECTOR='co2ff', THIS%PARAMID=219200, THIS%NREQIN=0, THIS%SCALING=1.0 /
&NAMCOMPO_EMIS THIS%SPECIES='CO2_GHG', THIS%SECTOR='co2air01', THIS%PARAMID=219201, THIS%NREQIN=0, THIS%SCALING=1.0, THIS%VERTICAL_PROFILE_TYPE='AltitudeRange', THIS%VERTICAL_BASE_HEIGHT=0.0, THIS%VERTICAL_TOP_HEIGHT=610.0 /
